        "TileImage": "$($repository aa0e779d-17aa-4657-ad8b-97770ae1ff7a).Image",
        "Description": "Chit has ordered some creatures from an invasive humanoid species to invade a fashion show and disrupt in from the inside. This is in an attenmpt to keep the infamous patagonia brand as the top fashion choice, to gain more controll over the global public, therefore increasing his political power to further his regime. His diabolical plans must be stopped at abny cost. Go get it Agent 47. The Chit awaits.",
